  translation {
    text: "Affected stops:\r\n17th Ave & Esplanade (#10284) (eastbound)\r\n17th Ave & Fillmore St (#10288) (eastbound)\r\n17th Ave & Steele St (#10323) (eastbound)\r\n17th Ave & Cook St (#10281) (eastbound)\r\n17th Ave & Garfield St (#10291) (eastbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & 17th Ave (#13053) (eastbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & Montview Blvd (#13137) (eastbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & 23rd Ave (#13058) (eastbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & 23rd Ave (#13057) (westbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & Montview Blvd (#13138) (westbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & 17th Ave (#13054) (westbound)\r\n17th Ave & Garfield St (#10292) (westbound)\r\n17th Ave & Madison St (#10308) (westbound)\r\n17th Ave & Steele St (#10325) (westbound)\r\n17th Ave & Fillmore St (#10289) (westbound)\r\n17th Ave & Esplanade (#10285) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\n17th Ave & Josephine St (#10335)\r\n23rd Ave & Birch St (#10569)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\n23rd Ave & Albion St (#10568)\r\n18th Ave & York St (#10346)"
